# Rust
prototype/target/
prototype/**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed — postern-diff is a binary workspace and we
# want reproducible builds across machines + CI.

# Paper artifacts
paper/paper.pdf
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log

